                            	  2493: SecretArmosXs:
02:000392A4 E0              	  2494:     dc.b    $E0, $B0, $B0, $30, $40, $90, $A0
02:000392A5 B0
02:000392A6 B0
02:000392A7 30
02:000392A8 40
02:000392A9 90
02:000392AA A0
