02:0003A746 0003A752        	  5370:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003A74A 0003A7B6        	  5371:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
