                            	  5248: _L_z07_UpdateArrowOrBoomerang_CompareLimit:
                            	  5249:     ; For boomerangs, compare it to the movement limit.
                            	  5250:     ; If it reached the limit, set state $20 and a new movement
                            	  5251:     ; limit of $10, and go handle the rest as if blocked.
                            	  5252:     ; State $20 will become $30 below in HandleArrowOrBoomerangBlocked.
                            	  5253:     ;
                            	  5254:     ; Otherwise, only animate and check collision as usual.
                            	  5255:     ;
                            	  5256:     ; In major state $30, ObjMovingLimit is a timer to change the state to $40.
                            	  5257:     ;
